  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the EU EOM to Zimbabwe 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is the implementation of logistics, security, financial and administrative aspects of the 2023 EU EOM to Zimbabwe, for the General Elections, scheduled for the 23rd of August 2023, with a possible second round. IOM will select of team of experts (Project Manager, Logistics Expert, Security Expert, IT Expert, Finance &amp; Contract Expert, two Liaison Officers) who will be deployed to Harare from end of June 2023 to end of October 2023 to implement the mission. The EOM will be composed by a Chief Observer, a Core Team of 11 members, 46 Long Term Observers and 44 Short Term Observers. IOM will have no visibility in the project.</narrative>
  </description>
